格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 工作区文件资源管理器:右侧目录树面板,点击/拖拽文件引用进输入框,UI 对齐 DSH 原生风格 | Workspace file explorer plugin for DeepSeek Harness: right-side file tree panel, click or drag file references into the composer, native DSH look","id":"gh:1334015817","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-workspace-explorer","slug":"Jiyr0119/dsh-workspace-explorer","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","file-explorer"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 工作区文件资源管理器:右侧目录树面板,点击/拖拽文件引用进输入框,UI 对齐 DSH 原生风格 | Workspace file explorer plugin fo"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r DeepSeek Harness: right-side file tree panel, click or drag file references into the composer, nat"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"arness: right-side file tree panel, click or drag file references into the composer, native DSH look"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-workspace-explorer"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"⭐ If you find this useful, give it a Star — it makes the author's day  ·  ★ Give a Star"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> A workspace file explorer for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI: a **“Workspace Files” capsule button in"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" the session header** (feature name + folder icon, beside the Session log button) opens an animated "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"popup showing the current workspace's directory tree — click or drag a file to send its reference to"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ng the current workspace's directory tree — click or drag a file to send its reference to the model."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Inspired by the VS Code / Cursor project tree, filling the gap of a missing directory view in DSH af"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ter workspaces are added."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🖥 Demo"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"*Demo GIF (recorded at v0.5.1): the **“Workspace Files” pill entry**, multi-select batch insert, fol"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"der drag → compact tree text, paginated preview, and the settings tab. The v0.6.0 split-view preview"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" and file editing are shown in the screenshots below.*"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Screenshots · 截图"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- 📂 **Animated popup** — a **“Workspace Files” capsule button** (feature name + folder icon, same st"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"yle as the native **Session log** download button) sits in the session header and opens a floating p"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"anel with a spring-like fade/scale-in animation; the popup is measured live to sit **between the ses"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"sion header and the composer** (the chat area's right side), so it never covers the input box\n- 🗂 **"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"Top tab bar** — click at the top of the panel to switch between Files and Settings; the Settings pag"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"e tunes behavior live (hide noise dirs, show sizes, reference format, preview lines, panel width) an"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"d mirrors into DSH Settings → Workspace Explorer\n- 🗂 **Lazy-loading tree** — directories load on dem"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"and; noise dirs (`node_modules`, `.git`, `dist`, `__pycache__`, …) are hidden automatically\n- 🎨 **Fi"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"le-type icons** — filled, color-coded document badges per extension (TS / JS / Python / JSON / Markd"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"own / image / config / shell, …); amber folders that brighten when expanded\n- 🖱 **Click to insert** "},{"id":"p11s11","text":"— click a file row to append a `[file: relative-path]` reference to the composer; after sending, the"},{"id":"p11s12","text":" model resolves it with its `read` tool\n- 🖱 **Drag & drop** — drop a file into the composer to inser"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"t at the caret (fullscreen dashed hint); dropping elsewhere appends to the end. **Folders are dragga"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"ble too** — dropping a directory inserts a depth-limited compact tree listing\n- 🖱 **Multi-select & b"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"atch insert** — Shift / ⌘ click to select multiple rows, then insert all of them at once (files → re"},{"id":"p11s16","text":"ferences, folders → tree listings)\n- 🌓 **Theme-aware** — built entirely on DSH's `--dsw-alias-*` des"},{"id":"p11s17","text":"ign tokens; adapts to light/dark with a native dialog look (16px radius, lv3 shadow)\n- 🔍 **Search & "},{"id":"p11s18","text":"filter** — filter files by name across loaded directories (flat result list with a match count)\n- 👁 "},{"id":"p11s19","text":"**Paginated preview** — preview any text file with prev/next line paging (total lines & current page"},{"id":"p11s20","text":" shown); insert the reference, or paste the full content for small files (≤ 32 KB)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Installation & usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Way 1 · Native install via `dsh plugin add` / storefront (recommended)**\nOne command installs the "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"full plugin — no build step, no config changes. The npm package ships a native host half (`lib/index"},{"id":"p14s3","text":".js`, webServer JSON routes incl. `/dsh-we/api/config`) **and** a browser bundle (`lib/client.js` vi"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"a `dsh.plugin.json`)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"(or click the install button in the DSH market). After install, a **“Workspace Files” pill (name + i"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"con)** appears in the session header; restart or hard-refresh the web UI if needed. This is the zero"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"-config, no-build path."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Way 2 · npm source package (manual paste)**\n`npm install @jiyr0119/dsh-workspace-explorer` — the p"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ackage ships `dynamic/host.js` / `dynamic/client.js` for the manual paste flow below, with semver re"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ships `dynamic/host.js` / `dynamic/client.js` for the manual paste flow below, with semver releases."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Way 3 · Dynamic plugin paste (zero-build fallback)**\nA *dynamic Cordis plugin*: no build step, no "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"config changes — useful for quick experimentation or environments without the storefront."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. In the DSH web UI, have an agent run `cordis_define` (or use the dynamic plugin panel) with `idPr"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"efix` `wsex`.\n2. Paste the whole `dynamic/host.js` into **Host code**.\n3. Paste the whole `dynamic/c"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"lient.js` into **Client code**.\n4. `cordis_run` to activate; authorize on the Run card when it first"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" appears.\n5. Click the **“Workspace Files” pill** (name + folder icon) in the session header → expan"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"d directories → click a file, or drag it into the composer, then send."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> ℹ️ **pnpm note**: modern pnpm (9/10) refuses to add a dependency at the workspace root (`ERR_PNPM_"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ADDING_TO_ROOT`), hence the `-w` flag above. Alternative: create `~/.dsh/profiles/web/.npmrc` contai"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ning `ignore-workspace-root-check=true`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Common misconception**: a listing alone never auto-installs anything — users still click inst"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"all. With Way 1 the full UI now appears after install (native bundle, v0.4.0+ verified with a clean "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`dsh plugin add` — no boot errors)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"See `docs/install.md` for details."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. Click the **“Workspace Files” pill** (feature name + folder icon) at the top right of the session"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" header, beside the Session log button, to open the popup.\n2. Expand directories to browse files.\n3."},{"id":"p24s3","text":" Click a file, or drag it into the composer, then send.\n4. Use the **Settings** tab at the top of th"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"e popup (or DSH Settings → Workspace Explorer) to adjust panel behavior."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Project Structure"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Implementation Notes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Capability | Mechanism |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Directory listing | Host `fs.resolve` / `fs.listDir` |\n| Host→Client RPC | `harness.handle('ws-tre"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"e.list' / 'ws-tree.peek')` ↔ `host.call(...)` |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
